<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded Union Pacific to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised the target price to $100 from $75.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Union Pacific were trading off 1/8 at 69-7/8.</p>
</text>
